
### 폴더구조
VETAgent/
│
├── checkpoints/                  # Trained model checkpoints
│   ├── backbone/                 # VETNet backbone weights
│   └── diagnoser/                # Diagnoser model weights
│
├── configs/                      # YAML configuration files
│
├── data/                         # Datasets (not included in repo)
│   ├── CSD/                      # Desnowing dataset
│   ├── DayRainDrop_Train/        # Raindrop dataset (day)
│   ├── NightRainDrop_Train/      # Raindrop dataset (night)
│   ├── rain100H/                 # Heavy rain dataset
│   ├── rain100L/                 # Light rain dataset
│   ├── GOPRO/                    # Motion blur dataset
│   ├── HIDE_dataset/             # Real blur dataset
│   └── RESIDE-6K/                # Dehazing dataset
│
├── models/                       # Backbone model implementations
│   ├── backbone/                 # VETNet backbone architecture
│   ├── __init__.py
│   └── __pycache__/
│
├── results/                      # Inference and evaluation outputs
│
├── script/                       # Training / evaluation scripts
│   ├── train_backbone_vetnet.py
│   ├── train_diagnoser_d1.py
│   ├── infer_backbone_vetnet.py
│   ├── eval_backbone.py
│   ├── check_cfg.py
│   ├── check_factory.py
│   ├── check_meta_imports.py
│   └── __pycache__/
│
├── vetagent/                     # Core Agent framework (main package)
│   ├── adapters/                 # Tool adapters / interface modules
│   ├── config/                   # Config schema & loader
│   ├── core/                     # Agent core logic
│   ├── diagnose/                 # Diagnoser modules
│   │   ├── diagnoser_net.py
│   │   └── diagnoser_rule.py
│   ├── factory/                  # Model/Module factory builders
│   ├── logger/                   # Logging / reporting utilities
│   ├── meta/                     # Meta information & compatibility checks
│   ├── modules/                  # Shared building blocks
│   ├── __init__.py
│   └── version.py
│
└── .gitignore